  "solution": "The logic followed here is: **(Second number - third number) + 10 = First number.**\n\nNow, \n\nFor, **(122, 136, 24)**\n\n(136 - 24) + 10\n\n112 + 10\n\n122 = 122.\n\n**(222, 248, 36)**\n\n(248 - 36) + 10\n\n212 + 10\n\n222 = 222.\n\nLet's check each option One by One:\n\nOption 1) (301, 367, 78)\n\n(367 - 78) + 10\n\n389 + 10\n\n399 ≠ 301.\n\nOption 2) (189, 213, 32)\n\n(213 - 32) + 10\n\n181 + 10\n\n191 ≠ 189.\n\nOption 3) (145, 244, 89)\n\n(244 - 89) + 10\n\n155 + 10\n\n165 ≠ 145.\n\n**Option 4) (212, 258, 56)**\n\n(258 - 56) + 10\n\n202 + 10\n\n**212 = 212.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 4'.***",
